    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Have you always dreamed of owning your own supermarket?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a humble store and expand it into an unstoppable franchise.Manage products, upgrade your facilities, hire staff, and keep the money flowing. All with one clear goal: reach the top <strong>and become a billionaire.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848570/extras/d8a2d143a5b0a51e442f72160a9c57eb.avif?t=1754064073\" width=800 height=458 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade and unlock an incredible range of products!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and upgrade your supermarket products to generate amazing passive income nonstop! The better your products, the more you earn...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848570/extras/26382d11bcc837ad7c3023882030b622.poster.avif?t=1754064073\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848570/extras/26382d11bcc837ad7c3023882030b622.webm?t=1754064073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848570/extras/26382d11bcc837ad7c3023882030b622.mp4?t=1754064073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Improve your supermarket facilities!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each upgrade gives you bonuses so powerful, even your products will want to work overtime.<br>Make your store the envy of the neighborhood and watch your bank account grow without breaking a sweat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848570/extras/4d5aea1389983880ba025712b37ed84a.poster.avif?t=1754064073\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848570/extras/4d5aea1389983880ba025712b37ed84a.webm?t=1754064073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848570/extras/4d5aea1389983880ba025712b37ed84a.mp4?t=1754064073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hire employees!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire all kinds of employees who do the work for you<strong>\u2026\u00a0</strong>while you just sit back and watch the money roll in!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848570/extras/17d751899b75c21800bf0e139a9dfae2.poster.avif?t=1754064073\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848570/extras/17d751899b75c21800bf0e139a9dfae2.webm?t=1754064073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848570/extras/17d751899b75c21800bf0e139a9dfae2.mp4?t=1754064073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >But most of all... become a billionaire!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell products, earn money to upgrade your supermarket, and unlock new opportunities. Every sale brings you one step closer to your ultimate goal: <strong>becoming an unstoppable billionaire!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848570/extras/232202ad35eb04caccbc40123de4d15f.poster.avif?t=1754064073\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848570/extras/232202ad35eb04caccbc40123de4d15f.webm?t=1754064073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848570/extras/232202ad35eb04caccbc40123de4d15f.mp4?t=1754064073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Have you always dreamed of owning your own supermarket?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a humble store and expand it into an unstoppable franchise.Manage products, upgrade your facilities, hire staff, and keep the money flowing. All with one clear goal: reach the top <strong>and become a billionaire.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848570/extras/d8a2d143a5b0a51e442f72160a9c57eb.avif?t=1754064073\" width=800 height=458 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade and unlock an incredible range of products!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and upgrade your supermarket products to generate amazing passive income nonstop! The better your products, the more you earn...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848570/extras/26382d11bcc837ad7c3023882030b622.poster.avif?t=1754064073\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848570/extras/26382d11bcc837ad7c3023882030b622.webm?t=1754064073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848570/extras/26382d11bcc837ad7c3023882030b622.mp4?t=1754064073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Improve your supermarket facilities!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each upgrade gives you bonuses so powerful, even your products will want to work overtime.<br>Make your store the envy of the neighborhood and watch your bank account grow without breaking a sweat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848570/extras/4d5aea1389983880ba025712b37ed84a.poster.avif?t=1754064073\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848570/extras/4d5aea1389983880ba025712b37ed84a.webm?t=1754064073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848570/extras/4d5aea1389983880ba025712b37ed84a.mp4?t=1754064073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hire employees!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire all kinds of employees who do the work for you<strong>\u2026\u00a0</strong>while you just sit back and watch the money roll in!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848570/extras/17d751899b75c21800bf0e139a9dfae2.poster.avif?t=1754064073\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848570/extras/17d751899b75c21800bf0e139a9dfae2.webm?t=1754064073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848570/extras/17d751899b75c21800bf0e139a9dfae2.mp4?t=1754064073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >But most of all... become a billionaire!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell products, earn money to upgrade your supermarket, and unlock new opportunities. Every sale brings you one step closer to your ultimate goal: <strong>becoming an unstoppable billionaire!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848570/extras/232202ad35eb04caccbc40123de4d15f.poster.avif?t=1754064073\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848570/extras/232202ad35eb04caccbc40123de4d15f.webm?t=1754064073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848570/extras/232202ad35eb04caccbc40123de4d15f.mp4?t=1754064073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
